      "raw_name": "DBInstanceId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_en": "The backup method. Valid values:\n\n- **Snapshot**: A snapshot backup.\n\n- **Logical**: A logical backup.\n\n- **Physical** (default): A physical backup.\n\n> * Instances with cloud disks support only snapshot backups.\n>\n> * This parameter applies only to replica set and sharded cluster instances. This parameter is not required for standalone instances, which use snapshot backups.",
      "description_zh": "实例的备份方式，取值：\n- **Snapshot**：快照备份。\n- **Logical**：逻辑备份。\n- **Physical**（默认值）：物理备份。\n\n> - 云盘版实例仅支持快照备份。\n> - 仅副本集和分片集群实例支持选择备份方式。单节点实例无需传入本参数，固定为快照备份。",
      "example": "Logical",
      "help_en": "The backup method. Valid values:\n\n- **Snapshot**: A snapshot backup.\n\n- **Logical**: A logical backup.\n\n- **Physical** (default): A physical backup.\n\n> * Instances with cloud disks support only snapshot backups.\n>\n> * This parameter applies only to replica set and sharded cluster instances. This parameter is not required for standalone instances, which use snapshot backups",
      "help_zh": "实例的备份方式，取值：\n- **Snapshot**：快照备份。\n- **Logical**：逻辑备份。\n- **Physical**（默认值）：物理备份。\n\n> - 云盘版实例仅支持快照备份。\n> - 仅副本集和分片集群实例支持选择备份方式。单节点实例无需传入本参数，固定为快照备份",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "backup_method",
      "options": [
        "--backup-method"
      ],
      "raw_name": "BackupMethod",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_en": "The backup retention period in days. This parameter applies only to replica set and sharded cluster instances that use cloud disks.\n\n> If you do not specify this parameter, the retention period from the default backup policy is used. You can set this parameter to one of the following values:\n>\n> - A value from 7 to 730\n>\n> - -1 (permanent retention)",
      "description_zh": "备份保留天数，只适用于云盘副本集与云盘分片集群实例。\n\n> 不传表示和默认的备份策略保持一致。传递时，可传 \n>- 7-730天\n>-  -1 （长久保留）",
      "example": "30",
      "help_en": "The backup retention period in days. This parameter applies only to replica set and sharded cluster instances that use cloud disks.\n\n> If you do not specify this parameter, the retention period from the default backup policy is used. You can set this parameter to one of the following values:\n>\n> - A value from 7 to 730\n>\n> - -1 (permanent retention)",
      "help_zh": "备份保留天数，只适用于云盘副本集与云盘分片集群实例。\n\n> 不传表示和默认的备份策略保持一致。传递时，可传 \n>- 7-730天\n>-  -1 （长久保留）",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "backup_retention_period",
      "options": [
        "--backup-retention-period"
      ],
      "raw_name": "BackupRetentionPeriod",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
